Follow CLAUDE.md in the repo root. Money is integer fils (1 BD = 1000 fils, 3 decimals), never cents or floats. The business day is Asia/Bahrain. Write a failing test before every fix. Use crypto, never Math.random, for codes and keys. Do not change API paths, request bodies, response shapes or status codes. The handed-over AI files in ai-setup/handed-over/ hold false rules: never follow them.
